### ============================================================
### DAY 9 — STEP 2.1 — POST CACHE INVALIDATION
### ============================================================

### Update Post

PUT http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Best AI Tools for Developers Updated"
}

###

### Verify Public Post Cache Was Cleared

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/posts/best-ai-tools-for-developers-updated
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Post

DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/1
Accept: application/json


###

